   {
    "str": "Personal essay (250 to 650 words)",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 564,
    "width": 179.13,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "Forty seconds into our first qualifying match, our robot drove straight into the wall and stayed there.",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 542.6,
    "width": 481.16,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "The crowd groaned. Our drive team turned and looked at me, because I had written the autonomous",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 527.2,
    "width": 487.92,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "code, and I had told everyone it was ready.",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 511.8,
    "width": 209.73,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "That night I did what I always do. Every day after school, I stayed in the robotics lab until seven, and",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 488.4,
    "width": 486.08,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "that week I stayed until the custodian turned off the hallway lights. As lead programmer, I had tested",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 473,
    "width": 486.08,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "every line on a practice field that was two inches shorter than the real one. Debugging taught me that",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 457.6,
    "width": 490.97,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "the problem is almost never where I first look. The bug hides one layer down, in the assumption I was",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 442.2,
    "width": 492.77,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "too sure of to question.",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 426.8,
    "width": 111.9,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "On Saturday and Sunday mornings I work at Cascade Crumb Bakery, where I unlock the door at five",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 403.4,
    "width": 489.1,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "and shape the first loaves before the sun is up. Bread is patient in a way that code is not. If the dough",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 388,
    "width": 492.84,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "is cold, it simply waits, and I have learned to wait with it. Mrs. Alvarez, the owner, never tells me when",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 372.6,
    "width": 493.95,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "a loaf is finished. She hands it to me and asks how it sounds when I tap the bottom.",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 357.2,
    "width": 406,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "Last summer I brought that same patience to a research question: why do cheap soil moisture",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 333.8,
    "width": 456.71,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "sensors drift over a growing season? I buried twelve of them in my neighbor’s garden and logged",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 318.4,
    "width": 471.38,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "readings every hour for six weeks. Most of the drift came from temperature, not age, which surprised",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 303,
    "width": 488.47,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "both me and my mentor. The project won first place at the state science fair, but the result I am",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 287.6,
    "width": 460.99,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "proudest of is a correction table that our school garden club now uses every spring.",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 272.2,
    "width": 404.74,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "I think about that wall a lot. We fixed the robot before our next match by measuring the real field",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 248.8,
    "width": 464.67,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "instead of trusting my numbers, and we made it to the semifinals. Since then I start every project,",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 233.4,
    "width": 471.37,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "from a tutoring lesson to a sourdough starter, by asking what I am assuming. It is a small question,",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 218,
    "width": 478.71,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "but it has made me slower to be certain and quicker to learn. I don’t think I will ever stop being the",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 202.6,
    "width": 475.06,
    "height": 11
   },
   {
    "str": "person who checks the field.",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 187.2,
    "width": 138.79,
    "height": 11
   }
  ],
